    "chunk_text": "and Crist \u00e6fre wur\u00f0ige. Se dema him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Cy\u00f0 me \u00feinne naman butan \u00e6lcere yldinge, nu ic axie \u00f0us. Se godes cempa cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam cwellere \u00feus, Ic hatte Albanus, and ic on \u00feone H\u00e6lend gelyfe, se \u00f0e is Se cwellere andwyrde \u00feam arf\u00e6stan were, Gif \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6s ecan lifes ges\u00e6l\u00fee habban wylt, \u00feonne ne scealt Albanus him andwyrde, Eowre godas offrunga ne magon \u00fee ge deoflum offria\u00f0 eower gehelpan, ne Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a se dema deofollice yrsode, and het beswingan \u00feone halgan martyr, wende \u00fe\u00e6t he mihte his \u00d0a geseah se dema \u00fe\u00e6t he oferswy\u00f0an ne mihte \u00feone halgan wer mid \u00feam hetelicum witum ne fram \u00dea dydon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan swa swa hi het se dema, and leddon \u00f0one halgan to beheafdigenne; ac hi wurdon Hit gelamp \u00f0a swa \u00fe\u00e6t se geleafleasa dema ungereordod s\u00e6t on \u00f0\u00e6re ceastra o\u00f0 \u00e6fen, butan \u00e6lcere Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a Albanus efstan wolde to slege, and eode to \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fea\u00f0a he ofer \u00fea brycge ne mihte, and \u00dea wear\u00f0 se cwellere \u00fee hine acwellan sceolde \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t wundor abryrd, and awearp his swurd arn \u00f0a He wear\u00f0 \u00fea geanl\u00e6ht mid anr\u00e6dum geleafan, to \u00f0am halgan were \u00fee he beheafdian sceolde; and \u00fe\u00e6t \u00d0a w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6r gehende \u00feam halgan w\u00e6re an myrige dun mid wyrt",
